&lt;li&gt;Design and validate sovereign reference architectures&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run complex proofs of concept and pilots – performance, scalability, security and network connectivity tests with different data volumes – and translate the results into clear go/no-go recommendations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work hand in hand with sovereign cloud and storage partners: joint solution design, enablement of partner technical teams, co-selling and joint customer workshops.&lt;/li&gt;
